---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for honestacresgroup.com — what information Honest Acres Group collects, how it is used, and your choices."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: November 13, 2026</p>

      <p>
        This policy describes how {SITE.name} ("we," "us"), brokered by
        {' '}{SITE.brokerage.name}, handles information collected through
        this website, honestacresgroup.com. It is a plain-language summary
        of our practices — it is not a contract and does not create any
        brokerage relationship.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Information you give us:</strong> if you email us or (once
          enabled) submit our contact form, we receive your name, email
          address, phone number if you provide it, and the contents of your
          message — typically what kind of land you want to buy or sell.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Basic technical information:</strong> our hosting provider
          (Vercel) automatically logs standard server data such as IP
          address, browser type, and pages visited, for security and
          reliability. This site does not currently run advertising trackers.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your inquiry and provide real estate services you request.</li>
        <li>To send you information you asked for, such as new-listing or first-call-list updates.</li>
        <li>To operate, secure, and improve this website.</li>
        <li>To comply with Texas real estate law and our broker's record-keeping obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we do not do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not sell your personal information.</li>
        <li>We do not share it with marketers. We share it only with service providers who help us operate (such as email and website hosting), with our sponsoring broker as required for real estate transactions, or when required by law.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Texas privacy law note</h2>
      <p>
        The Texas Data Privacy and Security Act (TDPSA, Texas Business &amp;
        Commerce Code Chapter 541) generally does not apply to small
        businesses as defined by the U.S. Small Business Administration,
        except that a small business may not sell sensitive personal data
        without consent — and we do not sell personal data at all. Whether
        or not the TDPSA applies to us, you may contact us at any time to
        ask what information we hold about you, to correct it, or to ask us
        to delete it, and we will honor reasonable requests.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site is a static website and does not set its own tracking
        cookies. If analytics or a contact-form provider is added later,
        this policy will be updated to describe it before or when it goes
        live.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This website is intended for adults interested in real estate and is not directed to children under 13.</p>

      <h2>Contact about privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Email {SITE.agent.name} at
        {' '}<a href={`mailto:${SITE.agent.email}`}>{SITE.agent.email}</a>.
        Broker: {SITE.brokerage.footerLine}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
